      {
        "id": "p35-q8-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\displaystyle\\frac{a^{2/3}+2a^{1/3}b^{1/3}+b^{2/3}-c^{2/3}}{a^{1/3}+b^{1/3}-c^{1/3}}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a^{1/3}+b^{1/3}+c^{1/3}$\n\nFactor the numerator as a difference of squares and cancel the denominator.",
          "worked": "Let $A=a^{1/3}$, $B=b^{1/3}$ and $C=c^{1/3}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{A^2+2AB+B^2-C^2}{A+B-C}&=\\frac{(A+B)^2-C^2}{A+B-C}\\\\\\frac{A^2+2AB+B^2-C^2}{A+B-C}&=\\frac{(A+B-C)(A+B+C)}{A+B-C}\\\\\\frac{A^2+2AB+B^2-C^2}{A+B-C}&=A+B+C\\\\\\frac{A^2+2AB+B^2-C^2}{A+B-C}&=a^{1/3}+b^{1/3}+c^{1/3}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
      {
        "id": "p35-q8-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\displaystyle\\frac{x^2+x^{-2}-1}{x+x^{-1}-3^{1/2}}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x+x^{-1}+3^{1/2}$\n\nUse $x^2+x^{-2}-1=(x+x^{-1})^2-3$ and cancel the common factor.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^2+x^{-2}-1}{x+x^{-1}-3^{1/2}}&=\\frac{(x+x^{-1})^2-3}{x+x^{-1}-3^{1/2}}\\\\\\frac{x^2+x^{-2}-1}{x+x^{-1}-3^{1/2}}&=\\frac{(x+x^{-1}-3^{1/2})(x+x^{-1}+3^{1/2})}{x+x^{-1}-3^{1/2}}\\\\\\frac{x^2+x^{-2}-1}{x+x^{-1}-3^{1/2}}&=x+x^{-1}+3^{1/2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      }
    ]
